<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 28/29.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 28/29.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Monday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 28/29. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	   July 28/29     July 25-28</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42701	   0.42872</p>
<p>    DKK    2.10137	   2.101  </p>
<p>    FIM    2.70581	   2.7053 </p>
<p>    GBP   24.42878	  24.44035</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07492	   0.07483</p>
<p>    LTL    3.68805	   3.66661</p>
<p>    LVL   25.33448	  25.2939</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00254	   0.00253</p>
<p>    SEK    1.86475	   1.85701</p>
<p>    UAH    7.94422	   7.89919</p>
<p>    USD   14.7548	   14.6692</p>
<p>    XEU   15.82305	  15.83687</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
